[node name="Instructions" type="RichTextLabel" parent="IntroPanel/MarginContainer/VBox/ScrollContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_colors/font_selected_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("4_vh6yr")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 20
theme_override_styles/normal = SubResource("StyleBoxFlat_vh6yr")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][b]MISSION BRIEFING[/b][/center]

You are the Authentication Controller for CyberCorp.
Your job: Verify user identities and grant appropriate access.

[b]HOW TO PLAY:[/b]
• Review each access request carefully
• Check user role, authentication level, and context
• DRAG a decision panel to the request card
• Click CONFIRM to finalize your decision
• Watch for red flags: unusual times, locations, requests

[b]DECISION OPTIONS:[/b]
✅ GRANT ACCESS = Allow the request
🔐 REQUIRE MFA = Request multi-factor authentication
❌ DENY ACCESS = Block the request

[b]REMEMBER:[/b]
✓ Authentication = WHO (verify identity)
✓ Authorization = WHAT (control access)
✓ Least Privilege = minimum access needed
✓ MFA = blocks 99% of attacks

[b]GOAL:[/b] Block attackers while allowing legitimate work.
Trust score below 20% = GAME OVER
"
fit_content = true

